[{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"卑南觅与水沙连，更有波澜万顷田。\n好续梁家詹事疏，一戈一甲乐尧年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1978,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"一碗糊涂粥共尝，地瓜土豆且充肠。\n萍飘幸到神仙府，始识人间有稻粱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1979,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"晨馐夕膳可能谋，罔极恩从死后酬。\n未必重泉真一饱，筵前争进九猪头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1980,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"有孝男儿来弄铙，有孝女儿来弄猴。\n升天成佛犹难必，先遣爷娘黑狱投。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1981,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"争将寸草报春晖，海上啼乌作队飞。\n慷慨更无人赠麦，翻凭百衲共成衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1982,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"搆屋空糜十万钱，化为灰烬亦堪怜。\n飘流多少加鸰仔，何处栖身觅一廛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1983,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"山邱零落黯然归，薤上方嗟露易晞。\n歌哭骤惊声错杂，红裙翠袖映麻衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1984,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"送终争欲饰奇珍，不智谁料启不仁。\n君看汉朝陵墓古，竟教玉碗落烽尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1985,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"箕中悬笔倩人扶，潦草依然鬼画符。\n道是长生真有药，九泉犹未觉迷途。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1986,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"夜合花开香满庭，鸳鸯待阙社犹停。\n怪来百两盈门日，三五微芒见小星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1987,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"张盖途行礼自持，文公巾帽意犹遗。\n一开一阖寻常事，不觉民风已暗移。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1988,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"爱恋曾无出里闾，同行更喜赋同车。\n手牵何事轻相放，黑齿雕题恐不如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1989,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"厚奁不惜橐金销，盼到堂前亚亚腰。\n犹藉鸡豚相馈遗，尽情只博大家烧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1990,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"烟草槟榔遍几家，金钱不惜掷泥沙。\n夕阳门巷香风送，拣得一篮鹰爪花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1991,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"火树千丛映绛霄，年年菜市闹花朝。\n路旁掩泣谁家子，失却鬟边翠玉翘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1992,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"清明时节雨初晞，楮陌纷纷化蝶飞。\n刚是重关斜照后，云鬟无数插青归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1993,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"竞送王爷上海坡，乌油小轿水边多。\n短幨三尺风吹起，斜日分明露翠蛾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1994,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"鸨儿原不及娘儿，聘结槟榔喜未迟。\n分得后生查亩仔，白头无复嫁尪时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1995,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"誓海盟山意正长，缠头百万亦寻常。\n三家村里盲儿鼓，犹唱当年黄锦娘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1996,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"撮合偏饶秘术多，莲花座下簇青娥。\n不图色相全空后，犹舍慈航渡爱河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1997,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"婢作夫人固有时，江沱江泛亦何辞。\n独怜赤脚厨头走，垂白无因著履綦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1998,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"睥睨东边列屋居，冶游只费杖头储。\n那知切里徵村外，别有催科到女闾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":1999,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"筠篮隐约盖微遮，月影朦胧路几叉。\n恰似纸钱送猫鬼，背人偷挂路旁花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2000,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"草鸡长耳乱经年，饲鸭狂徒更可怜。\n君看纷纷群蚁斗，槐安一郡已骚然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2001,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"同是萍浮傍海滨，此疆彼界辨何真。\n谁云百世雠当复，卖饼公羊始误人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2002,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"秋成争唱太平歌，谁识雈苻警转多。\n尾压未交田已做，却抛耒耜弄干戈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2003,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"草间狐兔每纵横，潜入崔嵬百雉城。\n夜半女墙斜月影，出关无事敩鸡鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2004,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"派饭曾无十日期，闯兄几辈似儿嬉。\n股头旗脚雄豪甚，釜底游鱼尚未知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2005,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"空把强弓毒矢施，藏山猛虎穴难窥。\n笑他北海孙宾石，复壁惟容一赵岐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2006,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"十六营兵饷已糜，更烦筹画到荒陲。\n千言侃侃飞书上，独有曹参不肯随。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2007,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"曾门溪畔少行人，草地常愁劫夺频。\n何似春风香脚好，去来无恙总依神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2008,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"夜半鸣金起僻隅，弓刀环集满街衢。\n但教户户都联络，明月花村犬吠无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2009,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"蔡郭黄卢大姓分，豪强往往虐榆枌。\n那知拔戟能成队，五色旌旗照海濆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2010,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"檨仔林边径路分，中藏罗汉脚纷纷。\n寄言玉局休相笑，担粪年来亦不群。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2011,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"骑轻从减历危途，化日终教照一隅。\n争按图经谭拓土，可能威惠似双梧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2012,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"依然朱邑祀桐乡，岁久方知惠泽长。\n八卦山前人似织，不关菊酒赛重阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2013,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"少时了了大时差，游戏徒教误岁华。\n莫惜十年迟树木，飘零容易是唐花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2014,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"鸡皮三少总人妖，莫讶娄猪定宋朝。\n不惜金笼饲黄脰，秋风无数老来娇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2015,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"兴筑功同苏白堤，政成偕乐与群黎。\n玉箫金管归何处，阁阁荒蛙傍草泥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2016,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"虎须手捋自棼迷，那更围鱼一网提。\n布裤不辞都脱却，春风处处勃鸠啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2017,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"赤嵌城里暂徘徊，一局棋兵两阵开。\n莫更旁观学王质，烂柯容易得归来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2018,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"密密根连未肯疏，故应外禦藉箖箊。\n大哥尾弟空联臂，持较同怀总不如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2019,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"灵根转眼化枯荄，毒火销磨百事乖。\n学得顾长康食蔗，漫云渐入境能佳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2020,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"舐罢馀丹尚共争，淮南鸡犬可怜生。\n漫将上下床分别，如豆灯光数不清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2021,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"耗费饔飧百口粮，如山狼籍不堪偿。\n伤财翻被居财误，浪说红龟是吉祥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2022,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"公门折节竞趋风，牵引都凭一线通。\n辛苦为人装布袋，肯教妙手独空空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2023,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"鼠牙雀角各争强，空费条条诰诫详。\n解释两家无限恨，不如银盒捧槟榔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2024,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"解从经史觅传薪，自有文章动鬼神。\n梦里几曾分五色，年年乞笔向鲲身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2025,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"井边下石忍相残，得势谁知失势难。\n潮长潮消期倍速，几人著眼海门看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2026,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"鸡似鸾凰彘似山，梨园子弟演分班。\n怪来海外都随俗，声味全无佛亦艰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2027,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"一席珍肴费数金，万钱日食更难禁。\n不如真率温公会，嘉话流传直到今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2028,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"杨仆楼船自列营，孙卢岛上尚纵横。\n薛文吉武威名在，如铁依然旧土城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2029,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"挂籍牙门意气盈，衅争往往启编氓。\n沈几谁似黄都阃，一语从容遏乱萌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2030,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"分疆画界立公厅，盘踞居然犄角形。\n传首已教心胆落，古来兵法本兼刑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2031,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"戎马书生气浩然，军中草檄笔如椽。\n功成不复论封赏，大海归来月满船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2032,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"一岛能伸气浩然，铺扬盛烈亦微权。\n覆盆冤诉何从达，金镜曈曈照海堧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2033,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"忠毅勋猷勒鼎钟，王邱英勇继前踪。\n手歼狂寇鲸波里，不愧天朝五等封。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2034,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"柯亭德教孰能如，遗墨犹黏四壁虚。\n东里西华憔悴甚，几人渡海吊幽居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2035,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"杀贼书生勇独饶，一门义烈薄云霄。\n未妨冷吃阑干菜，热血千年自不消。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2036,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"谁兴水利济瀛东，旱潦应资蓄泄功。\n溉遍陂田三万亩，至今遗圳说曹公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2037,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"鸿荒凿破海天空，慷慨当年赋大东。\n无数明珠遭按剑，怜才倍忆捞虾翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2038,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"养晦衡门亦自清，闾阎疾苦不关情。\n独怜头白归田叟，问俗犹闻太息声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2039,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"黄家亭馆傍城隅，一瓣香烧仰楷模。\n遂使陆机怀祖德，拜坟当日有遗图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2040,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"覆雨翻云事可欷，巨卿白马已称稀。\n君看札佐张巡检，朽骨犹能万里归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2041,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"交口争闻詈蠹胥，铮铮也有铁相如。\n一编抵得传家宝，我亦低头守拙居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2042,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"阐幽郡伯有传文，吴女沉冤得上闻。\n我向昭忠祠外过，披榛空访守娘坟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2043,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"贞烈陈黄报所天，捐躯无愧五妃贤。\n匆匆六甲光彤史，况沐皇风二百年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2044,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海音诗","author":"刘家谋","text":"四年炎海寄微官，虚吃天朝苜蓿餐。\n留得秦中新乐府，议婚伤宅总忧叹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2045,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古奇峰福神庙题壁断句","author":"刘黎光","text":"天外波涛何限阔，眼中城郭自然图。\n评诗有料山奚管，待客无僧酒作徒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2046,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"刺桐花","author":"潘鼎圭","text":"东瀛若木喷奇观，吐蕊铺朱刺眼寒。\n映日疑凝千滴血，烘云全迸一团丹。\n看培海国高文丽，似补中天正色完。\n彩颖遥挥霞片片，惊翻斗际落星弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2047,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事","author":"蒋兰畬","text":"指军无地强登山，铁炮烟销落日閒。\n破碎斗船沈马尾，悲哀奏疏动龙颜。\n九天帝命劳元老，五月王师下百蛮。\n大将已提淮北旅，澎湖飞渡入台湾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2048,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感事","author":"蒋兰畬","text":"蛮人自昔化难和，定乱三经马伏波。\n地控八闽门户险，民分两岛版图多。\n汉家已议捐炎海，越国何能王赵佗。\n孤负天南忠义士，同仇思保旧山河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2049,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日喜雨呈蒋怿庵镛刺史","author":"蔡廷兰","text":"赤熛扬明威，旱魃煽其怒。\n炎炳谁操持，阴阳失调护。\n万里烧长空，四围燃火树。\n草木燋乾枯，飞鸟不得度。\n泉壑绝涓流，禾苗尽偃仆。\n仰食资东瀛，舟楫来何暮。\n敢望盈箱求，翻遭闭籴误。\n一粒一酸辛，负挈满道路。\n吁嗟中泽鸿，几为涸辙鲋。\n贤哉良司牧，下车询农务。\n丰歉递相寻，灾祲亦定数。\n胡兹孤岛黔，奈何抱沉痼。\n圣世宏宽仁，轻徭复薄赋。\n无如瘠土贫，风旱频年遇。\n生计窘耕渔，颠连憯莫诉。\n我民竟何辜，对天默呼吁。\n方版疏一通，云坛香一炷。\n有谪则祸予，莫俾民太苦。\n忽然触石云，散作漫天雾。\n阴霾昼迷濛，玉虎晨鸣呴。\n列缺并飞廉，屏翳齐交互。\n须臾沛滂沱，岸谷倏崩注。\n或为空中丝，或似草间露。\n连朝积霪霖，十日沃沾霔。\n化泽遍均匀，天公周布濩。\n村墅沐新膏，原田发生趣。\n农夫拜官赐，一祷逢甘澍。\n早谷馀高粱，晚季卜秋穫。\n花生绵根荄，朱蓣长园圃。\n幸无台飓伤，又免蝗螟蠹。\n米价渐渐低，粮运源源赴。\n更须惩奸商，专市亦可恶。\n开仓议平粜，救荒良有具。\n驱鼠防穿墉，彻桑及未雨。\n惭予枵腹谈，迂腐呈俚句。\n蒿目怜苍黎，空拳策富裕。\n再三白当途，缓急慎所措。\n愿奉太平觞，讴歌乐含哺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2050,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶因购石作墙为里侩所阻将聚众斗矣急以诗代柬求王铁崖茂才解围事后喜而录之","author":"蔡廷兰","text":"君家世居铁铁尾，约去吾乡未三里。\n婚姻况乃朱陈谐，肥瘠岂如秦越视。\n我昨鸠工版筑兴，偶向君邻购石子。\n物各有主原非偷，售而得之乌容已。\n驱顽未学秦皇难，负重先教夸娥徙。\n无端局外声喧豗，攘臂突前相角抵。\n竟欲投辖同留宾，公然操杖辱加捶。\n初犹扣胫继撞胸，幸免折肱痛血指。\n试请息怒姑徐徐，云是此石渠曾市。\n就中委曲谁能知，遽呼宅主讯端委。\n主称典屋非卖石，署契分明敢谲诡。\n渠方气短歛足逃，衅由张三祸及李。\n寻常小隙抵死争，仓皇平地风波起。\n我闻众怒急缨冠，蛮触纷纷笑太鄙。\n会须登堂来负荆，排解先教达片纸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2051,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"避居公馆庄感作","author":"蔡见先","text":"咫尺桃源又有津，桑麻鸡犬自成春。\n微名冷比残宵梦，故友来如隔世人。\n久累刘伶惟酒债，暂随元亮作閒身。\n耽吟于事虽无补，聊洗胸中几斛尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2052,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]